<http://www.semanticweb.org/int-act-project/E2E3-ontology> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int-act-project/E2E3-ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <http://www.semanticweb.org/int-act-project/E2E3-ontology> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int-act-project/E2E3-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "INT-ACT UÉvora Team" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int-act-project/E2E3-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int-act-project/E2E3-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "E2E3 INT-ACT Ontology" .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int-act-project/E2E3-ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This ontology reuses and integrates the SKOS (Simple Knowledge Organization System) vocabulary for the organisation of domain-specific concepts, and builds upon the CIDOC Conceptual Reference Model (CRM) for the representation of cultural heritage entities and events." .
