<http://www.semanticweb.org/int-act-project/E2E3-ontology#mentions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.semanticweb.org/int-act-project/E2E3-ontology#P67_refers_to> .
